{"id":"416d22140327008ab79eb7d4918e98625c72dd00","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"416d22140327008ab79eb7d4918e98625c72dd00","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/readable-audit-deprecations.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pnpm\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm audit deprecations` now lists the deprecated versions of a package that share a deprecation message in one block, with the message shown once. Long dependency chains in `pnpm audit deprecations` and `pnpm audit engines` now show only the direct dependency and the two packages closest to the reported one."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/audit/deprecations.rs","lines":["@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@"," use super::{","     AuditGraph,","     HashMap,","+    HashSet,","     Include,","     PackageKey,","     PackageMetadata,","@@ -227,27 +228,83 @@ fn one_line(message: &str) -> String {","     sanitize_inline(&words.join(\" \")).into_owned()"," }"," ","+/// One block per package name and deprecation message: the message, then","+/// each deprecated version with where it comes from."," pub(super) fn render_deprecations(deprecated: &[DeprecatedPackage]) -> String {","     if deprecated.is_empty() {","         return \"No deprecated packages found\".to_string();","     }","-    let mut lines = Vec::new();","+    let groups = group_by_deprecation(deprecated);","+    let blocks: Vec<String> = groups","+        .iter()","+        .map(|group| render_group(group))","+        .collect();","+    let names = deprecated","+        .iter()","+        .map(|package| package.name.as_str())","+        .collect::<HashSet<_>>()","+        .len();","+    let versions = deprecated","+        .iter()","+        .map(|package| (package.name.as_str(), package.version.as_str()))","+        .collect::<HashSet<_>>()","+        .len();","+    let noun = if names == 1 { \"package\" } else { \"packages\" };","+    let summary = if names == versions {","+        format!(\"{names} deprecated {noun}\")","+    } else {","+        format!(\"{names} deprecated {noun}, {versions} versions\")","+    };","+    format!(\"{}\\n\\n{}\", blocks.join(\"\\n\\n\"), super::red(&summary))","+}","+","+/// The packages with the same name, message, and non-deprecated version,","+/// each group ordered by version.","+fn group_by_deprecation(deprecated: &[DeprecatedPackage]) -> Vec<Vec<&DeprecatedPackage>> {","+    let mut groups: Vec<Vec<&DeprecatedPackage>> = Vec::new();","+    let mut group_indexes = HashMap::new();","     for package in deprecated {","-        lines.push(format!(","-            \"{} {}  {}\",","-            super::bold(&sanitize_inline(&package.name)),","-            sanitize_inline(&package.version),","-            package.origin.render(),","-        ));","-        lines.push(format!(\"  {}\", package.deprecated));","-        if let Some(version) = &package.non_deprecated_version {","-            lines.push(format!(\"  {} is not deprecated\", super::green(version)));","-        }","+        let key = (&package.name, &package.deprecated, &package.non_deprecated_version);","+        let index = *group_indexes","+            .entry(key)","+            .or_insert_with(|| {","+                groups.push(Vec::new());","+                groups.len() - 1","+            });","+        groups[index].push(package);","+    }","+    for group in &mut groups {","+        group.sort_by_cached_key(|package| node_semver::Version::parse(&package.version).ok());","+    }","+    groups","+}","+","+fn render_group(group: &[&DeprecatedPackage]) -> String {","+    let first = group[0];","+    let name = super::bold(&sanitize_inline(&first.name));","+    let header = match &first.non_deprecated_version {","+        Some(version) => format!(","+            \"{name}  newest non-deprecated version: {}\",","+            super::green(&sanitize_inline(version)),","+        ),","+        None => name,","+    };","+    let mut lines = vec![header, format!(\"  {}\", first.deprecated)];","+    let versions: Vec<_> = group","+        .iter()","+        .map(|package| sanitize_inline(&package.version))","+        .collect();","+    let width = versions","+        .iter()","+        .map(|version| version.chars())","+        .map(Iterator::count)","+        .max()","+        .unwrap_or_default();","+    for (package, version) in group.iter().zip(&versions) {","+        lines.push(","+            format!(\"  {version:<width$}  {}\", package.origin.render()).trim_end().to_string(),","+        );","     }","-    let count = deprecated.len();","-    let noun = if count == 1 { \"package\" } else { \"packages\" };","-    lines.push(String::new());","-    lines.push(super::red(&format!(\"{count} deprecated {noun}\")));","     lines.join(\"\\n\")"," }"," "],"additions":72,"deletions":15,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/audit/deprecations/tests.rs","lines":["@@ -79,17 +79,63 @@ fn renders_projects_and_the_chain_of_a_subdependency() {","     let mut request = package(\"request\", &[\".\", \"packages/a\", \"packages/b\", \"packages/c\"], &[]);","     request.non_deprecated_version = Some(\"3.0.0\".to_string());","     let output = render_deprecations(&[request, package(\"uuid\", &[], &[\"request\", \"har\"])]);","+    eprintln!(\"OUTPUT:\\n{output}\\n\");","     assert_eq!(","         output,","-        \"request 1.0.0  ., packages/a, packages/b and 1 more\\n  \\","+        \"request  newest non-deprecated version: 3.0.0\\n  \\","          request is no longer maintained\\n  \\","-         3.0.0 is not deprecated\\n\\","-         uuid 1.0.0  via request > har\\n  \\","-         uuid is no longer maintained\\n\\n\\","+         1.0.0  ., packages/a, packages/b and 1 more\\n\\","+         \\n\\","+         uuid\\n  \\","+         uuid is no longer maintained\\n  \\","+         1.0.0  via request > har\\n\\","+         \\n\\","          2 deprecated packages\",","     );"," }"," ","+#[test]","+fn groups_the_versions_that_share_a_message() {","+    let versions = [\"11.1.0\", \"7.2.3\", \"8.1.0\"].map(|version| {","+        let mut glob = package(\"glob\", &[], &[\"foo\"]);","+        glob.version = version.to_string();","+        glob.deprecated = \"Old versions of glob are not supported\".to_string();","+        glob","+    });","+    let mut other_message = package(\"glob\", &[], &[\"bar\"]);","+    other_message.version = \"6.0.0\".to_string();","+    other_message.deprecated = \"Use a newer glob\".to_string();","+    let packages: Vec<_> = versions","+        .into_iter()","+        .chain([other_message])","+        .collect();","+    let output = render_deprecations(&packages);","+    eprintln!(\"OUTPUT:\\n{output}\\n\");","+    assert_eq!(","+        output,","+        \"glob\\n  \\","+         Old versions of glob are not supported\\n  \\","+         7.2.3   via foo\\n  \\","+         8.1.0   via foo\\n  \\","+         11.1.0  via foo\\n\\","+         \\n\\","+         glob\\n  \\","+         Use a newer glob\\n  \\","+         6.0.0  via bar\\n\\","+         \\n\\","+         1 deprecated package, 4 versions\",","+    );","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn counts_a_version_installed_from_two_registries_once() {","+    let mut from_work = package(\"foo\", &[], &[\"bar\"]);","+    from_work.key = \"foo@work:1.0.0\".parse().expect(\"package key\");","+    let output = render_deprecations(&[package(\"foo\", &[], &[\"baz\"]), from_work]);","+    eprintln!(\"OUTPUT:\\n{output}\\n\");","+    assert!(output.ends_with(\"\\n1 deprecated package\"), \"{output}\");","+}","+"," #[test]"," fn renders_a_clean_result() {","     assert_eq!(render_deprecations(&[]), \"No deprecated packages found\");"],"additions":50,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/audit/origins.rs","lines":["@@ -22,6 +22,13 @@ use std::collections::BTreeSet;"," /// How many projects a package's line names before it counts the rest."," const MAX_LISTED_PROJECTS: usize = 3;"," ","+/// The longest chain a line names in full. A longer one keeps the","+/// dependency a project declares and the [`LISTED_CHAIN_TAIL`] packages","+/// closest to the package, with `...` between.","+const MAX_LISTED_CHAIN: usize = 4;","+","+const LISTED_CHAIN_TAIL: usize = 2;","+"," #[derive(Debug, Default, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize)]"," pub(super) struct Origin {","     /// The projects that declare the package as a direct dependency.","@@ -39,14 +46,11 @@ impl Origin {","     pub(super) fn render(&self) -> String {","         let clean = |label: &String| sanitize_inline(label).into_owned();","         if !self.via.is_empty() {","-            return format!(","-                \"via {}\",","-                self.via","-                    .iter()","-                    .map(clean)","-                    .collect::<Vec<_>>()","-                    .join(\" > \"),","-            );","+            let mut chain: Vec<String> = self.via.iter().map(clean).collect();","+            if chain.len() > MAX_LISTED_CHAIN {","+                chain.splice(1..chain.len() - LISTED_CHAIN_TAIL, [\"...\".to_string()]);","+            }","+            return format!(\"via {}\", chain.join(\" > \"));","         }","         let listed = self.projects","             .iter()"],"additions":12,"deletions":8,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/audit/origins/tests.rs","lines":["@@ -22,6 +22,14 @@ fn renders_the_chain_of_a_subdependency() {","     assert_eq!(origin.render(), \"via request > har\");"," }"," ","+#[test]","+fn shortens_a_long_chain_to_its_ends() {","+    let origin = Origin { projects: Vec::new(), via: labels(&[\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"d\", \"e\", \"f\"]) };","+    assert_eq!(origin.render(), \"via a > ... > e > f\");","+    let origin = Origin { projects: Vec::new(), via: labels(&[\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"d\"]) };","+    assert_eq!(origin.render(), \"via a > b > c > d\");","+}","+"," #[test]"," fn renders_the_first_projects_and_counts_the_rest() {","     let origin = Origin {"],"additions":8,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/audit/deprecations.rs","lines":["@@ -61,7 +61,8 @@ fn lists_a_deprecated_direct_dependency_and_fails() {"," ","     assert_failure(&output);","     let out = stdout(&output);","-    assert!(out.contains(&format!(\"{DEPRECATED} 1.0.0  .\")), \"{out}\");","+    assert!(out.starts_with(&format!(\"{DEPRECATED}\\n\")), \"{out}\");","+    assert!(out.contains(\"\\n  1.0.0  .\\n\"), \"{out}\");","     assert!(out.contains(\"1 deprecated package\"), \"{out}\");"," }"," ",""],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false}],"additions":149,"deletions":28,"truncated":false,"file_count":6},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:03:05.939909+00:00"}